# 1. Calibration
# THIS CALIBRATION CALIBRATES TO AVERAGES OVER MODEL AGES 1 TO 38, CORRESPONDING TO PHYSICAL AGES 22-59 IN THE DATA AS IN KAPLAN VIOLANTE
note: the code calibrate_history_independent_tax() has been modified to incorporate calinbration targets that are averages over ages 4 to 41, rather than over all ages, as done previously. 
 
julia --project=. -t 5
include("calibrate_history_independent_tax_Claude.jl")
result_calib = calibrate_history_independent_tax(nZ=15, nEps=11, nKappa=5, nA=151, 
                                                 calib = CalibrationParams(inner_xtol = 1e-7), 
                                                 lambdaMin = 1e-4);

=== Calibration targets ===
mean assets / mean labor income          = 0.58800000
true borrowing limit / mean labor income = 0.18000000
share negative liquid assets             = 0.26000000

